{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"This is a regular two-player variant against a local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or betting. It uses the regular 5,000 point target, 15 card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening threshold. The table rules are different: this version does not implement the sharing permission to go out, the special hidden hand bonus, the red-three replacement option, or its own house rules. If the stock cannot provide two cards, the round is evaluated.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"canasta-card-game UI copy.limits","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"canasta-card-game.copy.limits","keys":["canasta-card-game.copy.limits"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ini adalah varian dua-pemain biasa menentang lawan komputer setempat, bukan pemain berbilang dalam talian atau pertaruhan. Ia menggunakan sasaran titik-ZXQPH0000QXZ biasa, pembahagian kad-ZXQPH0001QXZ, tarikan dua kad dan ambang pembuka berdasar skor. Peraturan meja berbeza: versi ini tidak melaksanakan kebenaran perkongsian untuk keluar, bonus tangan tersembunyi khas, pilihan penggantian merah-tiga, atau peraturan rumah tersendiri. Jika stok tidak dapat menyediakan dua kad, pusingan dinilai.","record_id":"2f98a99407b9abd5caea16617d4e2b6ec7b543e536fe3d360fd41c34155e35a5","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.0220424368749974,"source":"This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"18eb51470cf7c3e8d0a4161c143b09519122c00980735a56ead28bf88b2dbd54","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ini adalah varian dua-pemain biasa menentang lawan komputer setempat, bukan pemain berbilang dalam talian atau pertaruhan. Ia menggunakan sasaran titik-5,000 biasa, pembahagian kad-15, tarikan dua kad dan ambang pembuka berdasar skor. Peraturan meja berbeza: versi ini tidak melaksanakan kebenaran perkongsian untuk keluar, bonus tangan tersembunyi khas, pilihan penggantian merah-tiga, atau peraturan rumah tersendiri. Jika stok tidak dapat menyediakan dua kad, pusingan dinilai.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
